# `_example` — App rule template

> **This is a template, not a real app.** Copy `apps/_example/` to
> `apps/<your-app>/` and replace the placeholder text below with the
> rules that govern that app.

This file shows what a per-app `AGENTS.md` looks like in a
{{.ProjectName}}-style monorepo. The structure is intentionally short:
the root `AGENTS.md` already carries the repository-wide invariants,
so per-app files should only encode what is **different** about this
app.

## Stack

