- Deploy: GitHub Actions → Vercel preview on PR, production on main

## App-specific rules

_Override or extend the root `AGENTS.md` here for this app only._

- The root rule "all timestamps in UTC" still applies; the app's
  user-facing UI additionally renders them in the visitor's locale
  via the `Intl.DateTimeFormat` boundary.
- The root rule "single bundled PR per refactor" is relaxed here when
  touching `apps/_example/migrations/` — each migration is its own
  PR for review traceability.

